<view class="page" data-b="B223"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B223" /><view class="title">时间块设置</view><view class="subtitle">调整显示精度和常用标签，不影响已记录时间。</view>
  <view class="card" data-b="B703"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B703" /><view class="section-title">显示时间与分格</view><view class="field-label">每天显示的时间</view><view class="time-fields"><picker mode="selector" range="{{hoursStart}}" value="{{settings.startHour}}" data-key="startHour" data-z="Z703-1" bindchange="setHour"><view class="picker">{{settings.startHour}}:00 开始</view></picker><picker mode="selector" range="{{hoursEnd}}" value="{{settings.endHour - 1}}" data-key="endHour" data-z="Z703-2" bindchange="setHour"><view class="picker">{{settings.endHour}}:00 结束</view></picker></view><view class="field-label">一小时分成</view><view class="mode-list"><view class="{{settings.mode === 2 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-mode="2" data-z="Z703-3" bindtap="setMode">2 格 · 30 + 30 分钟</view><view class="{{settings.mode === 3 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-mode="3" data-z="Z703-4" bindtap="setMode">3 格 · 30 + 15 + 15 分钟</view><view class="{{settings.mode === 4 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-mode="4" data-z="Z703-5" bindtap="setMode">4 格 · 每格 15 分钟</view></view></view>
  <view class="card" data-b="B704"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B704" /><view class="section-title">一级与二级标签</view><view class="subtitle">例如「瑜伽课」下面放「学员小王」。一次选块并点标签，就是一条记录。</view><view wx:for="{{palette}}" wx:key="id" class="palette-row"><text class="palette-dot {{item.color}}"></text><text class="level">{{item.parentId ? '└' : '●'}}</text><input class="input" value="{{item.title}}" maxlength="20" data-index="{{index}}" data-z="Z704-1" bindinput="editPalette" /></view><button class="btn secondary" data-z="Z704-2" bindtap="savePalette">保存标签名称</button><view class="divider"></view><view class="section-title">新增标签</view><view class="choice-row"><text class="{{newKind === 'primary' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-kind="primary" data-z="Z704-3" bindtap="newKind">一级标签</text><text class="{{newKind === 'child' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-kind="child" data-z="Z704-4" bindtap="newKind">二级标签</text></view><picker wx:if="{{newKind === 'child'}}" mode="selector" range="{{roots}}" value="{{rootIndex}}" data-z="Z704-5" bindchange="selectRoot"><view class="picker">归属：{{roots[rootIndex] || '先添加一级标签'}} ▾</view></picker><input class="input new-input" placeholder="标签名称，例如瑜伽课或学员小王" value="{{newTitle}}" maxlength="20" data-z="Z704-6" bindinput="newTitle" /><button class="btn" data-z="Z704-7" bindtap="addPalette">添加标签</button></view>
  <view class="card" data-b="B225"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B225" /><view class="row"><view><view class="section-title">时间块统计</view><view class="subtitle">按标签累计记录次数和时长</view></view><text class="link" data-z="Z225-1" bindtap="goStats">查看 ›</text></view></view>
</view>
